# NXDNGateway leg clone patch (see GATEWAY-PATCHES.md). R=required O=optional E=ensure
# Expected values are from the node's LIVE NXDNGateway.ini (Nov 13 2026).
# Pairing rule: gateway RptPort == leg MB [NXDN Network] LocalPort (33022);
# gateway LocalPort == leg MB [NXDN Network] GatewayPort (33021). The
# commented-out Kenwood/Icom RptPort lines in the live ini are comments
# and must stay untouched (the patcher is section-scoped and skips them).
R|General|RptPort|14021|33022
R|General|LocalPort|14020|33021
R|Log|FilePath|*|/var/log/mmdvm
R|Log|FileRoot|*|NXDNGateway-XNXDN
R|Network|Port|14050|14051
O|Remote Commands|Port|6075|6175
E|Network|Startup|
